Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's turn a thought to a task.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So press Right Option key,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,say the request shown below and press the right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,option key again to submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What this will do is this will create a new Claude
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,or a Codex session based on whatever you selected,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and it will send you a request as the input for that session.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can just look at the notch at the top
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and your request would be in, sending state initially.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the request is sent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you can open the chat box basically by tapping the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,notch and it will have your message as well as the model's response
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.29,0:00:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,there itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is a really easy way for you to trigger
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,new tasks from anywhere across your Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to switch windows, you don't have to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,switch apps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.37,0:00:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And look for, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.93,0:00:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,the terminal or where the Codex or Claude app is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.25,0:00:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you had a thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.29,0:00:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,you just have to unmute yourself by pressing the Right Option key and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:00:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,say, what do you want to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture whatever you want to capture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.77,0:00:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's a Slack link, if it's a Twitter link,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.53,0:01:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,if it's a YouTube video, if it's a blog that you're reading,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you can just copy that along with your dictation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,while you're dictating and you can just press the Right Option again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.09,0:01:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just press submit again and it will create
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.33,0:01:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,a new task there and there itself.
